{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"85eac5dab3c2094873a7c21bac770a2e7c9e52a1fab0de71dd7f111ae933251d","ja":"雪歩、真、静香の3人はバラエティ番組に出演。\n収録はにぎやかに進み、ラストを迎えて……","zh":"雪步、真、静香3人出演了综艺节目。\n录制在热闹的气氛中进行，并迎来了尾声……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"85f13b920468773e12a8163e32e0f232fc9094de2e3c6dfc4307e3f7b805801c","ja":"「……では最後に、スタジオゲストの\nお三方からお知らせです！」","zh":"“……那么最后，请演播室的\n三位嘉宾带来通知！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b6c0d6883c2e1c68c6c5f5a0da5a2da835960b87103ab41087e72ab09108f3e0","ja":"来週、私たち3人のファンイベントを\n開催させていただくことになりました！","zh":"下周，我们3个人要举办\n粉丝活动了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8325717b488a1dcf24213c763d393bb332c9c98deeb1120152e562c023a9cc06","ja":"ミニライブと握手会で、みんなに最高の時間を\nプレゼントするから、ぜひ遊びに来てね！","zh":"我们会通过小型演出和握手会，把最美好的时光\n作为礼物送给大家，请一定要来玩哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6a0867225bf60b620a9b09c1bd44d798aa0aba91780662ad5f7f7928701d37da","ja":"それと今回は、私たち3人がそれぞれ自分で考えた、\n特別なイベントもさせてもらう予定なんですぅ♪","zh":"而且这次，我们3个人各自构思的\n特别活动也预计要举办呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"070f74558e6078ed51f87c3e6f9e75b6d4276c876225b0954818dad2c367ecec","ja":"気合いを入れて準備を進めているので、\nどんなイベントになるのか楽しみにしていてください！","zh":"正在干劲十足地推进筹备，\n敬请期待这会是一场怎样的活动吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d27484772f84c1cc6d6edb78d1b8ea8fb7cb3832c3bbef2bd2a74b508548397d","ja":"お仕事、楽しかったね♪　静香ちゃんのおかげで\nイントロクイズもばっちりだったし。","zh":"工作很开心呢♪ 多亏了静香，\n猜前奏抢答环节也完全难不倒我们。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"47726c90451930b1de7bc314bcfd7c4eeb0a3737923a23bcee3b95d708ef8673","ja":"う～ん……やっぱりあの内容で……。\nでも、あれだと一部の人しか楽しめないかも……。","zh":"嗯～……果然还是用那个内容吧……\n可是那样的话，说不定就只有一部分人能乐在其中了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3eab4cc4f790dbb368f98d11fcf34f3d854faedd8ed6128996a25e2e6199f075","ja":"あれ？　静香、どうしたの？","zh":"哎？静香，怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a0f0890e3efc05a45b1fa6efb05e28ad828e054bb7ed8a3b4712d91e3913874b","ja":"……あっ！　す、すみません。\nじ、実は……。","zh":"……啊！对、对不起。\n其、其实……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1164.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b13d05bd539be5384f9c88d580e63ae618ba7bbb1b5fa75ddf97a9fe35652463","ja":"私、来週のイベントで何をするか、\n全然決まってないんです！！","zh":"我还没定好下周的活动上\n要做什么呢！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
